flowchart LR
    C[Client] --> GW[API gateway<br/>auth, per-client rate limit]
    GW --> SA[Search API<br/>cursor pagination, request validation]
    SA --> RC[(Redis<br/>results per search tuple,<br/>availability counts)]
    SA --> IDX[(Search index<br/>geo, filters, price bands)]
    SA --> RK[Ranking service]
    INV[(Inventory and rates DB)] -->|CDC| K[Kafka]
    K --> P1[Index updater] --> IDX
    K --> P2[Availability projector] --> RC
    SA -.on booking click.-> BK[Booking service<br/>re-checks inventory]
